{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373","id":45189421,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NTE4OTQyMQ==","number":373,"title":"handle_sni crashes the Python Interpreter","user":{"login":"mhils","id":1019198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTkxOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1019198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils","html_url":"https://github.com/mhils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":79336502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3OTMzNjUwMg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"d93f0b","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2014-10-08T00:30:24Z","updated_at":"2014-10-08T16:41:35Z","closed_at":"2014-10-08T16:41:35Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"There's some weird SSL behaviour, which can be triggered by running mitmproxy with\n\n```\nmitmdump --cert cert.pem\n```\n\n[cert.pem](http://maximilianhils.com/upload/2014-10/cert.pem) (self-signed CA cert + leaf including privkey)\n\nFor some reason, this triggers a \n\n```\n`('SSL routines', 'SSL3_GET_CLIENT_HELLO', 'no shared cipher')`\n```\n\nin [server.py#L195](https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/blob/fbc4bb38df48447f846ae0ff4f87062c827bd632/libmproxy/proxy/server.py#L195). What's even more weird is that `handle_sni` is called a second time when the server conn has already been cleaned up ([server.py#L96](https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/blob/fbc4bb38df48447f846ae0ff4f87062c827bd632/libmproxy/proxy/server.py#L96)). The python interpreter crashes when the first call to `handle_sni` updates the context ([server.py#L275](https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/blob/fbc4bb38df48447f846ae0ff4f87062c827bd632/libmproxy/proxy/server.py#L275)). If we remove `connection.set_context(new_context)`, we get a traceback at least, but that doesn't really explain why it's called twice in the first place.\n\nLogs: https://gist.github.com/mhils/d58537ed2a1f484cc3ae\n","closed_by":{"login":"mhils","id":1019198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTkxOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1019198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils","html_url":"https://github.com/mhils","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhils/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitmproxy/mitmproxy/issues/373/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}